We each got on our own bikes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please go first."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
